  ['Ando Hiroshige','Distant View of Mount Akiha, Kakegawa','https://www.nga.gov/artworks/224457-distant-view-mount-akiha-kakegawa'],
  ['Ando Hiroshige','Fujisawa-shuku','https://www.nga.gov/artworks/181425-fujisawa-shuku']
